---
// Experience.astro — Professional work history (newest-first)
// Four employers: FSCPay, AT&T (with three progressive roles), Tannery Row, Glimpse
---

<section class="experience">
  <h2 id="experience">Experience</h2>

  <div class="employers-grid">
    <!-- AT&T: People Analytics (Software Engineer → Senior Software Engineer) -->
    <article class="employer-card">
      <div class="employer-header">
        <h3>AT&T</h3>
        <span class="employer-duration">Nov 2021 – Jun 2025 · 3 yrs 8 mos</span>
      </div>
      <p class="employer-location">Chicago, IL · People Analytics</p>

      <div class="roles-list">
        <div class="role">
          <div class="role-header">
            <h4>Software Engineer → Senior Software Engineer, People Analytics</h4>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ul class="role-bullets">
        <li>Promoted to Senior within first year on a startup-style HR analytics team; shipped PLE reporting tool (<strong>1M+ reports/year</strong>) and HRMAN (company-wide RBAC service).</li>
        <!-- src: internal HR system -->
        <li>Rearchitected backend with Spring AOP for <strong>40% memory reduction</strong>; grew team from 5 to 12 engineers with onboarding guide cutting ramp-up from 3 days to 1.</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="employer-tags">
        <span class="tag">Java</span>
        <span class="tag">Spring Boot</span>
        <span class="tag">Angular</span>
        <span class="tag">Azure</span>
        <span class="tag">Vertica</span>
        <span class="tag">Redis</span>
        <span class="tag">RBAC</span>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- FSCPay: Technical Cofounder + Lead Software Engineer -->
    <article class="employer-card">
      <div class="employer-header">
        <h3>FSCPay</h3>
        <span class="employer-duration">Oct 2025 – Present</span>
      </div>
      <p class="employer-location">Chicago, IL</p>

      <div class="roles-list">
        <div class="role">
          <div class="role-header">
            <h4>Technical Cofounder</h4>
            <span class="role-duration">Self-employed, Oct 2025 – Present</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="role">
          <div class="role-header">
            <h4>Lead Software Engineer</h4>
            <span class="role-duration">Freelance, Aug 2025 – Present · Remote</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ul class="role-bullets">
        <li>Technical cofounder and lead backend engineer for fintech startup building AI-enhanced payment processing.</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="employer-tags">
        <span class="tag">Java</span>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- The Tannery Row: Technology & Operations Lead -->
    <article class="employer-card">
      <div class="employer-header">
        <h3>The Tannery Row</h3>
        <span class="employer-duration">Dec 2018 – Present · 5 yrs 8 mos</span>
      </div>
      <p class="employer-location">Chicago, IL · On-site</p>

      <div class="roles-list">
        <div class="role">
          <div class="role-header">
            <h4>Technology & Operations Lead</h4>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ul class="role-bullets">
        <li>Built GTM-based product-feed API for Squarespace store; grew organic traffic to rival direct channels; shipped ECM-ai automation tool.</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="employer-tags">
        <span class="tag">Google Tag Manager</span>
        <span class="tag">Squarespace</span>
        <span class="tag">SEO</span>
        <span class="tag">Python</span>
        <span class="tag">RBAC</span>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Glimpse: UI/UX Developer & Co-Founder -->
    <article class="employer-card">
      <div class="employer-header">
        <h3>Glimpse</h3>
        <span class="employer-duration">2014 – 2018 · 4 yrs</span>
      </div>
      <p class="employer-location">Illinois</p>

      <div class="roles-list">
        <div class="role">
          <div class="role-header">
            <h4>UI/UX Developer & Co-Founder</h4>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ul class="role-bullets">
        <li>Built and released the social media app <strong>"Glimpse"</strong> (Swift); won <strong>best in Illinois in the Verizon Innovative App Challenge</strong> and pitched the app to live audiences and investors — later rebranded and sold after my departure.</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="employer-tags">
        <span class="tag">Swift</span>
        <span class="tag">iOS</span>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .experience {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: var(--width-container);
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-20);
    padding: var(--space-12) var(--space-8);
  }

  /* Override shared section h2 */
  .experience h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .employers-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    margin-top: var(--space-10);
  }

  /* Employer card styling */
  .employer-card {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: var(--space-6);
    transition: border-color var(--duration-base) var(--ease-in-out),
                background-color var(--duration-base) var(--ease-in-out);
  }

  .employer-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .employer-card {
      transition: none;
    }
  }

  /* Employer header: company name + total duration */
  .employer-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .employer-header h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: var(--leading-tight);
  }

  .employer-duration {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* Employer location */
  .employer-location {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4) 0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
  }

  /* Roles list container */
  .roles-list {
    margin: var(--space-4) 0 var(--space-6) 0;
  }

  /* Individual role */
  .role {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }

  .role:last-child {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  /* Role header: title + duration */
  .role-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .role-header h4 {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .role-duration {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* Role context (e.g., "Hybrid", "Remote") */
  .role-context {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3) 0;
  }

  /* Role description (used for Tannery Row pointer) */
  .role-description {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    margin: var(--space-4) 0 0 0;
  }

  /* Role bullets */
  .role-bullets {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4) 0;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
  }

  .role-bullets li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
    padding-left: var(--space-4);
    position: relative;
  }

  .role-bullets li::before {
    content: '•';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* Employer tags */
  .employer-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
  }

  .tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    background-color: var(--color-code-bg);
    color: var(--color-code-text);
    padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-2);
    border-radius: 2px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
  }

  .trajectory-bridge {
    background-color: transparent;
    border: none;
    padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-6);
    text-align: center;
    min-height: auto;
  }

  .trajectory-bridge:hover {
    background-color: transparent;
    border: none;
  }

  .trajectory-note {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: var(--leading-normal);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  /* Responsive adjustments */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .experience {
      width: calc(100% + 2 * var(--space-4)) !important;
      max-width: none !important;
      margin: 0 calc(-1 * var(--space-4)) var(--space-20) calc(-1 * var(--space-4)) !important;
      padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-2);
    }

    .employer-card {
      padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-4);
    }

    .employer-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .employer-duration {
      white-space: normal;
    }

    .role-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .role-duration {
      white-space: normal;
    }

    .employer-tags {
      gap: var(--space-2);
    }
  }
</style>
